# Architecture documentation maintenance

Follow the architecture documentation workflow in `AGENTS.md` after every meaningful
implementation step. Update the canonical Mermaid diagram and contracts in
`docs/architecture.md`, review the ADR index in `docs/adr/README.md`, and record the
review in the architecture maintenance log before moving to the next step.

When behavior changes an architectural decision, add a new numbered ADR and link
any superseded decision. Preserve accepted history. When architecture is unchanged,
record that explicitly; avoid cosmetic diagram changes.
